POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vinuka",
  "email": "vinuka999@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}



### Login User

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vinuka9999@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


